      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "It sits 7 miles southwest of Harlingen’s center and 4 miles north of the Rio Grande, placing it just outside the city’s core.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
